<title>NETHERLANDS: Rood Technology to open Irish subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Rood Technology to open Irish subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch semiconductor testing and assembly group Rood Technology NV said on Wednesday it would open an outlet in the Irish capital Dublin next month.</p>
<p>The unit will offer programming and lead conditioning services to the growing semiconductor sector in Ireland and will require an initial investment of about 1.5 million guilders.</p>
<p>With the support of Ireland's Industrial Development Authority, 21 new jobs have been created at the new subsidiary, Rood said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
